Interesting...with pure fighting classes, I usually don't stop running
full tilt until I've hit the bottom of the mine. How are you
characters passing away? Starvation? A horde of nasties? 

If it is the latter, then I'd suggest doing some modification to your
playing style - sammies are tanks, but they are not invincible. Make
use of any offensive wands you can find, and face your foes
one-on-one. Learn how to use doorways, corridors and other narrow
passages to increase your odds in winning prolonged fights, keep near
the stairs if necessary, and try to avoid getting pinned down in a
corner at all costs. The last two are especially true for the first
few levels of the Mines - don't be afraid of the dark, but do leave
yourself in good position for either fight or flight.

 
