A definite step up from your regular katana. Use it until you can
#enhance your long sword slot to skilled, then work on #dual
wielding with Snick and your original katana. You should hitting
expert with a long sword by the time you're hitting minetown.
Depending on how it seems the RNG is feeling, I'll sometimes head back
once I've hit Minetown and do Sokoban while I'm working on getting my
dual-wielding up, then go back and finish the bottom half of the Mines
once I've gotten the Sokoban goodies.

I wouldn't even bother trying to advance the wakizashi or the yumi.
I usually sell them at the first general/weapon store I can find.


